# Codex: Guide for Translating to pt-BR

> **Prefix:** `codex-` | **Type:** Reference Manual | **Scope:** Translation to pt-BR

## Key Terms

| English | Action | pt-BR |
|---------|--------|-------|
| commit, merge, branch, PR | Keep | — |
| workflow | Translate | fluxo de trabalho |
| output/input | Translate | saída / entrada |
| bug, feature | Translate | defeito / funcionalidade |

## Formalization

- Obligation: "O agente **DEVE**..." (not "tem que")
- Necessity: "É necessário..." (not "Precisa")
- Recommendation: "Recomenda-se..." (not "É bom que")

## Pitfalls

- "excluir" not "deletar"
- "configurar" not "setar"
- "executar" not "rodar"
- "verificar" not "checar"
- Avoid excessive gerund usage
